---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /contact.html
title: "Contact Us — Jing · Meet China"
description: "Contact Jing · Meet China. Send your travel ideas and get a reply within 24 hours. Offices in Shanghai and Beijing, 24/7 English-speaking support."
active: "contact"
sections:
  - label: "Page Hero"
    html: |
      <section class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('assets/img/dest-guilin.png');">
            <div class="container">
              <span class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Contact</span>
              <h1>Let's Plan Your Trip Together</h1>
              <p>Questions, ideas, or ready to start? Send us a message — a real travel designer (not a bot) will reply within 24 hours.</p>
            </div>
          </section>
  - label: "Contact Content"
    html: |
      <section class="section">
            <div class="container">
              <div class="contact-split">
      
                <!-- Form -->
                <div class="contact-form-panel reveal">
                  <span class="eyebrow">Send a Message</span>
                  <h2 class="display-h2" style="margin: 14px 0 10px;">Tell us about your trip</h2>
                  <p class="form-lead">A real travel designer reads every message. Share a few details and we'll reply within 24 hours.</p>
                  <form class="js-form" novalidate>
                    <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="69287e76-7c72-482f-ab86-4efba6d503ed" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New travel inquiry — Jing · Meet China" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Jing · Meet China" />
                    <input type="text" name="botcheck" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;" />
                    <div class="form-grid">
                      <div class="form-field">
                        <label for="c-name">Full Name <span class="req">*</span></label>
                        <input type="text" id="c-name" name="name" data-required placeholder="e.g. Emily Carter" />
                        <span class="error-msg">Please enter your name.</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="form-field">
                        <label for="c-email">Email Address <span class="req">*</span></label>
                        <input type="email" id="c-email" name="email" data-required placeholder="you@example.com" />
                        <span class="error-msg">Please enter a valid email address.</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="form-field">
                        <label for="c-whatsapp">WhatsApp <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
                        <input type="text" id="c-whatsapp" name="whatsapp" placeholder="e.g. +44 7700 900000" />
                      </div>
                      <div class="form-field">
                        <label for="c-wechat">WeChat <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
                        <input type="text" id="c-wechat" name="wechat" placeholder="e.g. jing_meetchina" />
                      </div>
                      <div class="form-field">
                        <label for="c-when">Planned Travel Time</label>
                        <input type="text" id="c-when" name="travel-time" placeholder="e.g. October 2026, ~10 days" />
                      </div>
                      <div class="form-field">
                        <label for="c-pref">Travel Preference</label>
                        <select id="c-pref" name="preference">
                          <option value="">Please select…</option>
                          <option>Cultural immersion</option>
                          <option>Nature &amp; landscapes</option>
                          <option>Food &amp; markets</option>
                          <option>Family-friendly journey</option>
                          <option>Premium &amp; luxury travel</option>
                          <option>Not sure yet — surprise me</option>
                        </select>
                      </div>
                      <div class="form-field full">
                        <label for="c-message">Your Message <span class="req">*</span></label>
                        <textarea id="c-message" name="message" data-required placeholder="Tell us about your dream trip — places you long to see, pace you prefer, anything that matters to you…"></textarea>
                        <span class="error-msg">Please tell us a little about your trip.</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="form-field full">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send Message <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="form-note">We answer every inquiry personally within 24 hours (usually much faster). Your details stay private — always.</p>
                    <p class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
                  </form>
                  <div class="form-success" role="status">
                    <div class="success-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
                    <h3>Message received — thank you!</h3>
                    <p>A travel designer will reply to your inbox within 24 hours. In the meantime, feel free to browse our signature journeys for inspiration.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
      
                <!-- Aside: branded info panel -->
                <aside class="contact-info-panel reveal reveal-d1">
                  <span class="eyebrow light">Get in Touch</span>
                  <h2 class="info-title">Talk to a real travel designer</h2>
                  <p class="info-lead">No call centers, no bots. Reach our Shanghai team any of these ways — we reply within 24 hours, usually much sooner.</p>
                  <ul class="info-list">
                    <li>
                      <span class="info-ic"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></span>
                      <div class="info-body">
                        <span class="info-k">Visit our offices</span>
                        <span class="info-v">上海市静安区北京西路大厦</span>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <span class="info-ic"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.79 19.79 0 0 1 2.12 4.18 2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg></span>
                      <div class="info-body">
                        <span class="info-k">Call or message</span>
                        <span class="info-v"><a href="tel:+8617782189330">+86 177 8218 9330</a></span>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <span class="info-ic"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"/></svg></span>
                      <div class="info-body">
                        <span class="info-k">Email us</span>
                        <span class="info-v"><a href="mailto:zjonny338@gmail.com">zjonny338@gmail.com</a></span>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <span class="info-ic"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg></span>
                      <div class="info-body">
                        <span class="info-k">WeChat</span>
                        <span class="info-v">Inside_China01</span>
                      </div>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                  <div class="info-foot">
                    <div class="info-hours">
                      <span class="info-k">Office hours (GMT+8)</span>
                      <div class="hours-grid">
                        <div><span>Mon – Fri</span><b>09:00–18:00</b></div>
                        <div><span>Saturday</span><b>10:00–16:00</b></div>
                        <div><span>Sunday</span><b>Closed</b></div>
                        <div><span>On-trip</span><b>24 / 7</b></div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </aside>
      
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
  - label: "CTA"
    html: |
      <section class="cta-band">
            <div class="container cta-inner">
              <div>
                <h2>Not sure where to begin?</h2>
                <p>Browse our four signature journeys for inspiration — then tell us how you'd make them yours.</p>
              </div>
              <a href="tours.html" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Our Tours <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
            </div>
          </section>
---
{% for s in sections %}
